{"v":[{"n":1,"p":["Give thanks to the LORD, for He is good.","His loving devotion endures forever."],"h":"His Loving Devotion Endures Forever"},{"n":2,"p":["Give thanks to the God of gods.","His loving devotion endures forever."]},{"n":3,"p":["Give thanks to the Lord of lords.","His loving devotion endures forever."]},{"n":4,"p":["He alone does great wonders.","His loving devotion endures forever."]},{"n":5,"p":["By His insight He made the heavens.","His loving devotion endures forever."]},{"n":6,"p":["He spread out the earth upon the waters.","His loving devotion endures forever."]},{"n":7,"p":["He made the great lights—","His loving devotion endures forever."]},{"n":8,"p":["the sun to rule the day,","His loving devotion endures forever."]},{"n":9,"p":["the moon and stars to govern the night.","His loving devotion endures forever."]},{"n":10,"p":["He struck down the firstborn of Egypt","His loving devotion endures forever."]},{"n":11,"p":["and brought Israel out from among them","His loving devotion endures forever."]},{"n":12,"p":["with a mighty hand and an outstretched arm.","His loving devotion endures forever."]},{"n":13,"p":["He divided the Red Sea","in two","His loving devotion endures forever."]},{"n":14,"p":["and led Israel through the midst,","His loving devotion endures forever."]},{"n":15,"p":["but swept","Pharaoh and his army into the Red Sea.","His loving devotion endures forever."]},{"n":16,"p":["He led His people through the wilderness.","His loving devotion endures forever."]},{"n":17,"p":["He struck down great kings","His loving devotion endures forever."]},{"n":18,"p":["and slaughtered mighty kings—","His loving devotion endures forever."]},{"n":19,"p":["Sihon king of the Amorites","His loving devotion endures forever."]},{"n":20,"p":["and Og king of Bashan—","His loving devotion endures forever."]},{"n":21,"p":["and He gave their land as an inheritance,","His loving devotion endures forever."]},{"n":22,"p":["a heritage to His servant Israel.","His loving devotion endures forever."]},{"n":23,"p":["He remembered us in our low estate","His loving devotion endures forever."]},{"n":24,"p":["and freed us from our enemies.","His loving devotion endures forever."]},{"n":25,"p":["He gives food to every creature.","His loving devotion endures forever."]},{"n":26,"p":["Give thanks to the God of heaven!","His loving devotion endures forever."]}]}